            <h2>About Theodora</h2>
            <p>Licensed in New Jersey and New York, Theodora Boyadjis brings over a decade of experience in high-end residential and commercial design. Her work blends creativity with technical precision, grounded in a lifelong appreciation for craftsmanship.</p>
            <br>
            <p>Inspired early on by her grandfather, a finish carpenter, Theodora believes great architecture lies in the details - where beauty and function meets seamlessly.</p>
